---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { LINKS, linkClass, btnPlan, btnSecondary } from "../../lib/links";
import { withBase } from "../../lib/base";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Gun Store Software — Stack Literacy for FFLs | FFL Accelerator"
  description="Gun store software is several jobs: 4473/bound book, POS, ecommerce, and demand. FFL Accelerator is managed WooCommerce — not 4473 or ATF software. Point compliance tools elsewhere."
  path="/guides/gun-store-software"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:py-14">
    <p
      class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-sky-400"
    >
      Stack literacy
    </p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
      Gun store software is not one product
    </h1>
    <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
      Dealers search “best software for a gun store” and get a pile of
      unrelated tools. Bound-book and 4473 systems are not ecommerce. A POS is
      not a website. A website is not a sales index. FFL Accelerator is
      Coriolis’s managed WooCommerce program. It is{" "}
      <strong class="text-white">not 4473 software</strong>, not ATF software,
      and not a POS.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Four jobs, four boxes</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
      {
        [
          {
            t: "Compliance / records",
            d: "A&D book, 4473, e4473, eStorage. This is FastBound, FFL Safe, Orchid-class tools, and counsel — not Coriolis.",
          },
          {
            t: "Point of sale",
            d: "The register: AXIS, AIM, MicroBiz, Corestore, Trident, Rapid. Some of those stores also feed RetailBI. That is sell-through, not search intent.",
          },
          {
            t: "Ecommerce",
            d: "The public store you own. WooCommerce + FFL checkout + optional distributor catalogs. That is what FFL Accelerator runs.",
          },
          {
            t: "Demand on the site",
            d: "What shoppers asked for, including zeros. GunSearchAgent — Pro included on Accelerator. Not a unit-sales index.",
          },
        ].map((b) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">{b.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">{b.d}</p>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
      Where to look for compliance
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      We do not sell, resell, or automate ATF forms. If you need bound-book or
      4473 tooling, start with dedicated vendors — for example{" "}
      <a
        href={LINKS.fastBound}
        class={linkClass}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">FastBound</a
      >{" "}
      for serialized workflows, plus category specialists such as FFL Safe or
      Orchid Advisors for records and training. Evaluate them on current ATF
      rules, your volume, and your counsel. This page is literacy, not a
      recommendation engine and not legal advice.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
      What Coriolis will not claim
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-zinc-400">
      <li>No 4473 automation.</li>
      <li>No “we replace your bound book.”</li>
      <li>No “switch off RetailBI.”</li>
      <li>
        Ecommerce and Betsy coexist with the compliance stack you already trust.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-white">If the gap is the website</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      You already have a register and a records system. The public site is
      still rented, slow, or dark. That is the FFL Accelerator job: WooCommerce
      you own, $569/mo, GunSearchAgent Pro included. Soft next step — read the
      plan, or put free GSA on the site you have today.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href={LINKS.plans}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={btnPlan}
      >
        Coriolis plans →
      </a>
      <a
        href={LINKS.gsa}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class={btnSecondary}
      >
        Free GunSearchAgent
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-zinc-500">
      <a href={withBase("ffl-ecommerce")} class={linkClass}>FFL ecommerce →</a>
      {" · "}
      <a href={withBase("retailbi-and-axis")} class={linkClass}
        >AXIS / RetailBI →</a
      >
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
